{"segs": ["PA_ja_224:0.1", "PA_ja_224:0.2", "PA_ja_224:0.3"], "en": "Jātaka: The Second Book of Birth Stories (Dukanipāta), Chapter on the Yellow Robe (Kāsāvavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_224:0.4"], "en": "4. The Kumbhīla Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_224:1.1", "PA_ja_224:1.2"], "en": "“O Lord of Monkeys, for whomsoever these four qualities exist, just as they do in you—”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_224:1.3"], "en": "Truth, Dhamma, fortitude, and generosity—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_224:1.4", "PA_ja_224:2.1"], "en": "he transcends what is seen. But for one in whom these do not exist, [he does not transcend].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_224:2.2"], "en": "These qualities are most auspicious:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_224:2.3"], "en": "truth, the Dhamma, fortitude, and generosity—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_224:2.4"], "en": "he does not transgress what has been seen.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_224:3.1"], "en": "The Kumbhīla Jātaka, the fourth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
